  "description": "Deterministic PII detection and redaction for text leaving your perimeter: LLM prompts, logs, support tickets, exports. Finds and redacts emails, phone numbers, payment cards with Luhn validation and network identification (Visa, Mastercard, Amex, Verve, Discover, JCB), IBANs with full ISO 13616 mod-97 checksum, Nigerian NIN and BVN (context-gated), US SSNs with invalid-range rejection, IP and MAC addresses, JWTs and API keys with named provenance, and context-gated dates of birth. Four redaction modes: type-aware masking (PCI first6/last4 for cards), stable typed placeholders, salted SHA-256 pseudonymization, and reversible in-memory vault tokens. Offline, deterministic, zero external dependencies.",
